  "body": "For an installation guide, refer to the [README](https://github.com/stickerdaniel/linkedin-mcp-server/blob/main/README.md).\n\n## 📦 Update MCP Bundle Installation\n**For Claude Desktop users:**\n\n→ [Download linkedin-mcp-server-v4.24.3.mcpb](https://github.com/stickerdaniel/linkedin-mcp-server/releases/download/v4.24.3/linkedin-mcp-server-v4.24.3.mcpb)\n\nThen click the downloaded file to install in Claude Desktop.\n\n> **Note:** MCP Bundles do not auto-update. You need to download and install the latest `.mcpb` file for each new release.\n\n## 🐳 Update Docker Installation\n**For users with Docker-based MCP client configurations:**\n```bash\ndocker pull stickerdaniel/linkedin-mcp-server:latest\n```\nThe `latest` tag will always point to the most recent release.\nTo pull this specific version, run:\n```bash\ndocker pull stickerdaniel/linkedin-mcp-server:4.24.3\n```\n\n\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v4.24.3 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n* fix(readme): Render the Codex badge icon and drop Development by @stickerdaniel in https://github.com/stickerdaniel/linkedin-mcp-server/pull/984\n* fix(browser): Replace colliding import cookies by @tmedford in https://github.com/stickerdaniel/linkedin-mcp-server/pull/978\n\n## New Contributors\n* @tmedford made their first contribution in https://github.com/stickerdaniel/linkedin-mcp-server/pull/978\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/stickerdaniel/linkedin-mcp-server/compare/v4.24.2...v4.24.3",
